{"id":"366105e2ddae92b9","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-weightedstablepb.md","title":"Weighted stable sets as quadratic optimization","display":"thm-weightedstablepb — Weighted stable sets as quadratic optimization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-weightedstablepb","aliases":["27-thm-weightedstablepb"],"display":"thm-weightedstablepb — Weighted stable sets as quadratic optimization","depends_on":["[[27-df-indset]]","[[27-df-quadpb]]","[[27-df-pbopt]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.1","source_statement":"Application 13.1, Equation (13.2)","source_printed_pages":"565","source_pdf_pages":"589","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-statement-checked","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-weightedstablepb"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-weightedstablepb</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-weightedstablepb — Weighted stable sets as quadratic optimization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"641b6055573312df\" href=\"?note=641b6055573312df\" title=\"27-df-indset\">27-df-indset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db1311544a44ed95\" href=\"?note=db1311544a44ed95\" title=\"27-df-quadpb\">27-df-quadpb</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.1"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Application 13.1, Equation (13.2)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"565"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"589"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-statement-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,E)\">\\(G=(N,E)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}(G)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndSet}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{IndSet}(G)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"641b6055573312df\" href=\"?note=641b6055573312df\" title=\"27-df-indset\">27-df-indset</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w:N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(w:N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(M\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M&gt;\\max_{i\\in N}w(i)\">\\(M&gt;\\max_{i\\in N}w(i)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(q\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^nw(i)x_i-M\\sum_{\\{i,j\\}\\in E}x_ix_j\">\\(q(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^nw(i)x_i-M\\sum_{\\{i,j\\}\\in E}x_ix_j\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db1311544a44ed95\" href=\"?note=db1311544a44ed95\" title=\"27-df-quadpb\">27-df-quadpb</a>）和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBArgmax}\">\\(\\mathrm{PBArgmax}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\land\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}q(x)=\\max_{I\\in\\mathrm{IndSet}(G)}\\sum_{i\\in I}w(i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\land\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}q(x)=\\max_{I\\in\\mathrm{IndSet}(G)}\\sum_{i\\in I}w(i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(q)\\;\\left(\\{i\\in N\\mid x_i=1\\}\\in\\mathrm{IndSet}(G)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(q)\\;\\left(\\{i\\in N\\mid x_i=1\\}\\in\\mathrm{IndSet}(G)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Application 13.1、(13.2)，陈述已核对，本地补出证明：若 support 中含边，删除其一个端点 i 至少去掉一项 M 的惩罚，损失至多 w(i)，故目标严格增大，矛盾。所以最优 support 稳定；稳定点上惩罚为零。M 严格大于最大权重也覆盖零权重情形。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-indset","status":"resolved","id":"641b6055573312df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-indset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadpb","status":"resolved","id":"db1311544a44ed95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadpb]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbopt]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-indset","status":"resolved","id":"641b6055573312df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{>0}$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$G=(N,E)$ 且 $\\mathrm{Graph}(G)$；$\\mathrm{IndSet}(G)$（see [[27-df-indset]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadpb","status":"resolved","id":"db1311544a44ed95","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n$（see [[27-df-quadpb]]）和 $\\mathrm{PBArgmax}$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n$（see [[27-df-quadpb]]）和 $\\mathrm{PBArgmax}$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"G=(N,E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IndSet}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"w:N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"M>\\max_{i\\in N}w(i)","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"q(x)=\\sum_{i=1}^nw(i)x_i-M\\sum_{\\{i,j\\}\\in E}x_ix_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBArgmax}","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\land\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}q(x)=\\max_{I\\in\\mathrm{IndSet}(G)}\\sum_{i\\in I}w(i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(q)\\;\\left(\\{i\\in N\\mid x_i=1\\}\\in\\mathrm{IndSet}(G)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1866,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-590","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-weightedstablepb|thm-weightedstablepb — Weighted stable sets as quadratic optimization]]"}],"outgoing":["641b6055573312df","db1311544a44ed95","a668791f62b82e2a"]}